# Note: data/raw/ and models/ ARE committed deliberately.
# The raw CSV (1.0 MB) keeps the analysis reproducible from a clean clone, and
# model.joblib (0.5 MB) is what the Hugging Face Space serves. Both are well
# inside git's comfortable size range, so neither needs Git LFS.
